title: It can still show data!
pid: 541b3dcc-b45a-4dfd-8974-b4a82c768c67
body: |2-
  This differs from the current skg implemntation of a "deleted node" viewnode,
  which makes nothing available but the ID.
  It seems better to never show a deletion that way --
  instead, show it with its title,
  and if the user asks for them, even its content.
  (Deleted content would show as further 'deleted atom' viewnodes.)
